WEBVTT

00:12:58.836 --> 00:13:02.316
actually even kind of
the three-level layer

00:13:02.316 --> 00:13:03.636
that I like to talk about,

00:13:03.636 --> 00:13:06.516
which is the interpersonal level,
is an important one.

00:13:06.556 --> 00:13:08.996
The conversations
that we're having with each other

00:13:09.036 --> 00:13:11.396
and the stories that we're telling,

00:13:11.396 --> 00:13:13.876
when I, you know,
in the TED Talk, a little snippet,

00:13:13.876 --> 00:13:18.236
where we have mothers who feel
like they have to be selfless

00:13:18.276 --> 00:13:20.796
and that we celebrate mothers
for being selfless.

00:13:20.796 --> 00:13:22.916
So even around Mother's Day,
we say to moms,

00:13:22.956 --> 00:13:25.596
"Thank you for sacrificing
everything for me

00:13:25.596 --> 00:13:27.796
and for putting yourself
behind everybody."

00:13:27.796 --> 00:13:30.236
And yes, a lot of mothers have done that,